  "title": "GrandPerspective: Clean your Mac",
  "date": "2026-09-06T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "GrandPerspective: Clean your Mac\n\nOn Windows, I usually use SpaceSniffer to clean my PC.\nI wish there will be something alike on Mac. As I am using a Mac mini with a small storage of 256GB.\n\nThen I found GrandPerspective.\nJust like SpaceSniffer, it analysis the disk drive and displays the usage with blocks (though, ugly compared with SpaceSniffer).\nIt supports export file as text.\n\nAfter analysis, I export the disk data into text and using Calude to read it.It did a perfect job and export the result as an HTML.\n\nreport\n\nTurns out I have many Unreal Engine leftovers. I can move them to another disk.",
